==Battleground==
*10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*2 [[Haterbaa 2.0]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*4 [[Haterbaa 2.0]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 1.33~2.67 seconds<sup>40f~80f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*4 [[Haterbaa 2.0]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 1.33~2.67 seconds<sup>40f~80f</sup>.
*7 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 2~3 seconds<sup>60f~90f</sup>.
*3 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Haterbaa 2.0]]s spawn after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use fast-attacking cats like [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Lion Cat]] or [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|critical hitters]] like [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]] for the HaterBaa 2.0s as well as [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Reds]] for the B.B.Bunnies, Ginger Snaches, and One Horn. If you can get to the base fast enough, you can cheese the stage with the help of [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], or other [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rushers]].

